codex
The bounded symbolic claim for a five-coefficient polynomial now closes with `#Top`. I found a cleaner route toward an unbounded structural invariant: replacing the comprehension’s repeated list allocation with an equivalent explicit loop and `append` keeps one accumulator reference stable, which makes the supplied heap semantics inductive. I’m applying that equivalent implementation and attempting the stronger proof.
apply patch
