The proof decomposition is complete: the generalized loop invariant proves `#Top`, and the exhaustive empty/cons entry cases both prove `#Top` when using that already-proved invariant. I’m running the full recorded script from translation through LLVM execution and both proof phases once more as the final reproducibility check.
